 align=\"center\">M.Com</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 89.8417%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"464\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Commerce, More Details See Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.6039%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"157\">\n<p align=\"center\">B.Ed</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 89.8417%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"464\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree with 50% Marks for UR / EWS / OBC : 45% Marks for SC / ST, More Details See Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25.6039%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"157\">\n<p align=\"center\">M.Ed</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 89.8417%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"464\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree / Diploma in Education with 50% Marks</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 115.446%;\" colspan=\"8\" valign=\"top\" width=\"621\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Delhi University PG Course 2026 Details 2026</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2615%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 20.5922%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"141\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.592%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"299\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Course Name</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2615%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\n<p align=\"center\">M.A. Applied Psychology</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 20.5922%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"141\">\n<p align=\"center\">M.A. Philosophy</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.592%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"299\">\n<p align=\"center\">MA Psychology</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 33.2615%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"182\">\n<p align=\"center\">M.A. Sanskrit</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 20.5922%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"141\